# IDE actions invoke_ide_action may run without a prompt (one id per line). Everything else asks the maintainer.
# spross: Optimize Imports (the maintainer, 2026-10-23) and Save All, which writes what the IDE holds (2026-10-24);
# Move (members too) and Safe Delete, with Rename through mcp__idea__rename_refactoring (the weekly meeting, 2026-10-30,
# confirmed by the maintainer in session). Reformat Code stays off.
# The safeguards for every write action (SPROSS-00065): the absolute projectPath and get_repositories first, a VFS
# refresh (Synchronize) when files changed outside the IDE, Save All after it, then git status and git diff (spross
# only, nothing elsewhere); after a Rename or Move a repo-wide grep for the old name (docs, skills, tickets) and a
# compile; a rename on a serialized type or property runs its golden-file or round-trip spec. Never for a worktree,
# only while the maintainer is not typing in the IDE.
OptimizeImports
SaveAll
Move
SafeDelete
Synchronize
# ReformatCode: in the blueprint, off in ultra until the maintainer allows it (ULTRA-00237 only records Auto-Format differences)
